* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
*   call !tkform(op, ctx, a, b, c)            ALWAYS FIVE ARGUMENTS: a call with fewer stops with "Argument count mismatch" (pad with '')
*
*   The ops are $tk_form's: open, run, say and close.  THE FORM VALIDATES NOTHING: the program does, with its own checks, between run and close.  Close it on EVERY way out.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
